## Step 4: Testing the Modern `removed {}` Block

To test declarative resource removal, I created `own_remove.tf` alongside `own_res.tf`:

### `own_remove.tf`

```hcl
removed {
  from = aws_instance.own_mport_ec2
  lifecycle {
    destroy = false
  }
} 

```

